{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16601170","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16601170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1660117001:0":{"text":"ねえねえ、ヴェルディアの君たちに聞きたいんだけど、ヤクボルって知ってる？","source_cn":"来自绿裔的朋友，你们知道雅库伯尔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5698F118FC12936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1660117002:0":{"text":"ええ。賢者のダウナエおばあさまから聞いたことがあります。一万年前に、原始の獣人が遠路はるばるヤクボルからユグドラシルへ移り住み――","source_cn":"嗯，我曾听达赫妮贤者提起过。万年以前，有一群原始兽人不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38CD8357DA280D62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660117003:1":{"text":"それが、ヴェルディアの祖先の一部になったのだとか。","source_cn":"那些人应该就是如今一部分绿裔的先祖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34EB44999C45166A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1660117004:0":{"text":"祖先……？","source_cn":"等等……先祖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601841B16FF6B6FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660117005:1":{"text":"そう！あたしたちババリアとヴェルディアは、同じ祖先だったかもしれないの！","source_cn":"没错没错！我们蛮血和你们绿裔，可能有着共同的先祖哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968E4EFA588AF369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1660117006:1":{"text":"道理で、いつかヴェルディアの人とお友だちになれそうな予感がしてたのよね。もしかしたら、あたしたちの遠いご先祖様は、すっごく仲が良くて、一緒に暮らしてたかもしれないよ！","source_cn":"难怪有时我隐隐会觉得，说不定哪天能和绿裔成为朋友，看来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D0B004DE6002AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1660117007:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>がその目で見てなかったら、正直私もいまだに信じられないよ。","source_cn":"若非<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x702D10C787727979","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>がその目で見てなかったら、正直私もいまだに信じられないよ。","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>がその目で見てなかったら、正直私もいまだに信じられないよ。","variant_male_record_index":"216869","variant_female_record_index":"216870","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660117008:1":{"text":"そうそう！あたし、ずっとその長い耳が可愛いなって思ってたんだ！","source_cn":"哦，对！我一直想说，你的长耳朵好可爱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA5E1180EB2E60A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1660117009:1":{"text":"えっ……ありがとうございます。あなたの尻尾もとても素敵ですよ。","source_cn":"啊……谢谢你的夸奖，你的尾巴也很漂亮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x305BF54AC658F322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1660117010:0":{"text":"実に興味深い歴史だねぇ。ああ、ボクがもう少し早く生まれていたら、地上で面白いことをたくさん経験できていたかもしれないのに。","source_cn":"真是有趣的历史。可惜我出生得太晚，还生在昏暗的地下，都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCAD28DB9269DC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1660117011:1":{"text":"歴史というのはこのカードのようなものだ。いくら絵柄が多くても、裏面のままでは、どんなにシャッフルしても見えている柄は同じなんだよ。","source_cn":"看吧，历史就像我手里的这副牌，看似花色各异，洗来洗去，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF30309327F25CA99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1660117012:0":{"text":"たとえの意味がよく分かりませんが……","source_cn":"这个比喻很奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528F0E071211F3FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1660117013:1":{"text":"それよりも私は、我々の祖先のことをもっと詳しく知りたいと思ったよ。","source_cn":"比起这些，我更想知道我们先祖的故事。详细一点的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5F6296A3389527B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1660117014:1":{"text":"……真面目君め。","source_cn":"唉，多么无趣的人啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C178CCF4E451490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1660117015:0":{"text":"いいわよ！この話は何回しても飽きないもの！","source_cn":"没关系，我很乐意再讲述一遍这个故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0EC546984E2DB46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":